.page egrep 1 grep with extended regular expressions

# SYNOPSIS
*egrep* [_OPTION_...] _PATTERN_ [_FILE_...]

# DESCRIPTION
`egrep` is `grep -E`: the pattern is an extended regular expression. All the options of grep(1) are accepted.

# EXAMPLES
    egrep 'root|reimu' /Hakurei/etc/passwd
    ls | egrep '\.(c|h)$'

# SEE ALSO
grep(1), fgrep(1), regex(7)
